     "78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"], Cell["\<\
every hyperedge the evolution created, each as its id followed by its vertices\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"], Cell[TextData[Cell[
    BoxData["\"\<InitialCondition\>\""], "InlineFormula",
