      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"],
     " (each vertex's point, keyed by the vertex as the states name it) and, \
where the generator gives them, ",
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<VertexCoordinates3D\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],
     " (each vertex's point on the embedded surface), ",
