      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "33e490f1-5bc8-e939-619b-09bb5e62b803"],
     ", an association from each vertex with a neighbour to its \
Ollivier-Ricci curvature k_v, the mean over its edges of the edge curvature ",
     
     Cell[BoxData["\"\<OllivierRicciCurvature\>\""], "InlineFormula",
      FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
      "794a4309-908b-2549-2f4a-5b53213f8f93"],
