  "601ed991-4af3-b103-1025-d0db6e870069"],
 " of the unreduced causal graph has as many edges as the reduced relation:"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->1647625689,ExpressionUUID->"27a3aaa2-c993-2819-4d50-430fe8267b63"],

