 CellID->1072982513,ExpressionUUID->"16ee990f-09f0-daa5-3e95-1169af8aa88f"],

Cell["\<\
Below 1, each transition is kept with the given probability. The draw depends \
on the transition's isomorphism-invariant identity, the seed and, under \
\"CanonicalizeStates\" None or Automatic, the step, so the same seed keeps \
the same transitions at any thread count and on either device:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->670671484,ExpressionUUID->"00067b34-c3cd-1811-303e-7371f6786b7b"],

