Cell["\<\
A state whose every draw failed keeps its lowest-keyed transition, so the \
sample reaches the requested depth at any rate. At 0.01 a single line of \
states reaches step 6:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->438320377,ExpressionUUID->"5f352ef2-4ae2-2c59-06ca-c7bc6e9776a3"],

