  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "53f282fc-d9f3-c4a2-0181-1bb9df87ae88"],
 ", a hyperedge of two vertices is an unordered pair. A left-hand edge ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y"}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "065deb70-832e-a04f-2e62-033a36d8f295"],
 " matches a hyperedge in either order, so the growth rule has two events on \
one hyperedge:"
}], "ExampleText",
