  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5ad9af22-3fdb-49f9-0ae6-468cba6e1bc3"],
 " shows the final step and the evolution graphs with branchial edges show \
every step. Three steps of the triangle rule have nine branchial pairs:"
}], "ExampleText",
 CellID->223022189,ExpressionUUID->"4cf910a9-0c85-fbc1-7486-89f3a531c92b"],

