The number of points of a sprinkling, a Brill-Lindquist, a Poisson or a \
uniform initial condition. Six points sprinkled into Minkowski space give a \
small causal set:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1668916953,ExpressionUUID->"5c2451d3-5dad-cf90-05dc-489d545995fa"],

